 is empty (cancel), the script prints nothing and exits 1.","fretish":"when empty_selection the dmenu_protocol shall eventually satisfy exit_one_on_empty"}},"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-9ABD","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-X6Z5","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-X6Z5"],"title":"When the done file exists but the selection file is empty (cancel), the script prints nothing and exits 1."},{"changeStatus":"modified","changedFields":[],"clause":{"base":{"description":"The listing matches the requested formats case-insensitively, prunes dotfiles and dot-directories, and sorts rows by modification time descending. The script rejects a nonexistent path on stderr with exit 1.","fretish":"when paths_given the file_picker shall eventually satisfy listing_shape"},"candidate":{"description":"The listing matches the requested formats case-insensitively, prunes dotfiles and dot-directories, and sorts rows by modification time descending. The script rejects a nonexistent path on stderr with exit 1.","fretish":"when paths_given the file_picker shall eventually satisfy listing_shape"}},"component":"menu","id":"SW-REQ-260922-HR29","parent":"SYS-REQ-260922-6642","satisfies":["SYS-REQ-260922-6642"],"title":"The listing matches the requested formats case-insensitively, prunes dotfiles and dot-directories, and sorts rows by modification time descending. The script rejects a nonexistent path on stderr with exit 1."},{"changeStatus":"modified","changedFields":[],"clause":{"base":{"description":"enable offers disabled plugins; disable offers enabled canDisable plugins; clone offers first-party plugins no installed clone points back at; remove offers non-first-party plugins.","fretish":"when picker_verb_given the plugin_picker shall eventually satisfy verb_filter_applied"},"candidate":{"description":"enable offers disabled plugins; disable offers enabled canDisable plugins; clone offers first-party plugins no installed clone points back at; remove offers non-first-party plugins.","fretish":"whe